"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"A 28-year-old admitted to shooting Mr. Thompson in Manhattan, leading to his death. The person pleaded guilty to stalking charges that resulted in death.\",            \"english_title\": \"Shooting in Manhattan\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una persona de 28 a\u00f1os admiti\u00f3 disparar al Sr. Thompson en Manhattan, causando su muerte. La persona se declar\u00f3 culpable de acoso que result\u00f3 en muerte.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Disparo en Manhattan\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A storm caused power outages for over 20,000 homes and left 7,000 people stuck at Tokyo's Narita airport.\",            \"english_title\": \"Storm Hits Tokyo\",            \"translated_version\": \"Una tormenta caus\u00f3 cortes de luz para m\u00e1s de 20,000 casas y dej\u00f3 a 7,000 personas atrapadas en el aeropuerto de Narita en Tokio.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Tormenta en Tokio\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Construction workers discovered a hidden stash in a cellar wall while working on sewage pipes.\",            \"english_title\": \"Hidden Stash Found\",            \"translated_version\": \"Trabajadores de construcci\u00f3n encontraron un escondite en una pared del s\u00f3tano mientras trabajaban en tuber\u00edas de desag\u00fce.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Escondite Encontrado\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Thousands of sailors on the Lincoln ship have faced food shortages and broken plumbing, with some thinking about jumping overboard.\",            \"english_title\": \"Problems on Lincoln Ship\",            \"translated_version\": \"Miles de marineros en el barco Lincoln han enfrentado falta de comida y tuber\u00edas rotas, con algunos pensando en saltar al agua.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Problemas en Barco Lincoln\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Officials 